# Weight profile nemotron-super-vl-exl3-2.5: NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Super VL 120B-A12B in our EXL3 pack: routed experts at 2.5 bits, the Mamba2, attention, latent and shared-expert projections at 4, head 6, MTP head 4
# (exllamav3 1.6.2 with the Puzzle/Bolt and Super VL patches, mul1 codebook; the vision tower kept in BF16 and not
# loaded), converted from nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B-BF16 at revision 97e00975. Text only.
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh nemotron-super-vl-exl3-2.5.
QSE_NH_MODEL=nemotron-3.5-super-vl-120b-a12b
QSE_NH_VARIANT=super-vl-exl3-2.5
QSE_NH_DIR=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-120b-a12b-exl3-2.5
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=TBD
MAX_LEN=262144
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the weights, the engine and its graphs, the allocator, the prefill workspace,
# three slots' KV and LiLiCorr's rings, LiLiCorr and the 15 GiB floor
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=70
MEM_CEILING_GIB=52
MEM_PEAK_GIB=56
# NVIDIA's LiLiCorr drafter for Super VL: a draft head of the tree drafter beside the lookup
QSE_NH_HEAD=lilicorr
QSE_NH_LILICORR=${HOME}/models/nemotron-3.5-super-vl-lilicorr
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_nemotron.env"
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=0xBakeer/TandemLLM-Nemotron-3.5-Super-VL-120B-A12B-EXL3-2.5
QSE_ASSETS="${QSE_NH_LILICORR}/model.safetensors"
